      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Rory from Lite Force was the least \"salesman\" of the quotes we received, he provided well explained options with facts at a good price and answered all our many questions very well. The instillation was done carefully and professionally, very tidy and cleaned up afterwards. Travelled at least 2-2.5 hours to get to us as well. All the paperwork was taken care of before during and after install, we only had to sign things, and Rory showed us how to use all the features and apps and graphs and such from the inverter. He knew the neighbourhood had a lot of solar panels and made sure to carefully explain what that meant for our solar generation, future plans for batteries etc. Highly recommended.",
